- `PUT /v1/kv/{url-encoded-key}` with `{"value": <json>, "ttl_seconds": <positive finite number>}`
- `GET /v1/kv/{url-encoded-key}`
- `DELETE /v1/kv/{url-encoded-key}`
- `GET /v1/keys`
- `GET /health`

